ельность.","desc_en":"When Ancient Apparition deals Magic damage to an enemy with his abilities, it is slowed for a short duration. If the target is a Hero, its Strength is also reduced. Multiple instances of this effect stack and have independent durations.","notes_ru":[],"notes_en":[],"specials":[{"key":"str_reduction","system":false,"heading_ru":"СНИЖЕНИЕ СИЛЫ:","heading_en":"STRENGTH REDUCTION:","values":[0.2],"percent":false,"values_scepter":[0.8]},{"key":"tooltip_scepter_bonus","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.8],"percent":false},{"key":"str_reduction_duration","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДЛИТЕЛЬНОСТЬ:","heading_en":"DURATION:","values":[4.0],"percent":false},{"key":"movement_slow_pct","system":false,"heading_ru":"ЗАМЕДЛЕНИЕ ПЕРЕДВИЖЕНИЯ:","heading_en":"MOVEMENT SLOW:","values":[2.0],"percent":false}],"shard":null,"scepter":{"text_ru":"Увеличивает базовое снижение силы на 0,3.","text_en":"Increases Base Strength Reduction by 0.8.","changes":[{"key":"str_reduction","heading_ru":"СНИЖЕНИЕ СИЛЫ:","from":[0.2],"to":[0.8]}]}},{"key":"ancient_apparition_ice_blast","id":5348,"hero":"ancient_apparition","name_ru":"Ice Blast","name_en":"Ice Blast","kind":"ultimate","innate":false,"granted_by_scepter":false,"granted_by_shard":false,"max_level":3,"behavior":["point","aoe"],"behavior_ru":["в точку","по области"],"target_team":[],"target_type":[],"target_flags":[],"damage_type":"magical","bkb_pierce":true,"immunity_code":3,"immunity":"enemies_yes","dispellable":"no","cooldown":[50.0,45.0,40.0],"mana_cost":[175.0],"health_cost":[],"gold_cost":[],"cast_range":[],"cast_point":[0.01,0.01,0.01],"channel_time":[],"duration":[],"desc_ru":"Отправляет снаряд в направлении выбранной точки на карте. Повторное применение запускает ледяной шар, который взорвётся там, где находился снаряд на момент активации. Чем дальше он пролетит, тем больше будет радиус взрыва. У врагов, которые оказались в радиусе взрыва или на пути ледяного шара, застывает кровь, отчего они получают периодический урон и не могут лечиться или восстанавливать здоровье. Если здоровье поражённой цели упадёт ниже определённого уровня, она мгновенно разобьётся на осколки.","desc_en":"Launches a tracer toward any location on the battlefield, which must be triggered again to mark the area to be blasted by a damaging explosion of hail. The further the tracer travels, the larger the explosion will be. Enemies caught in the explosion, or who touch the icy ball of hail as it travels, are Frostbitten, taking damage over time and prevented from regenerating or healing. If a Frostbitten unit's health drops below a certain percentage, they will instantly shatter.","notes_ru":["После применения эта способность заменяется на другую, которая отправит ледяной шар в указанную область.","Диаметр взрыва = 300 + 50 * время полёта, но не более 1000.","Убийство засчитывается тому, чей урон рассыпал цель на осколки.","Иллюзии не погибают при пересечении порога убийства.","Эффект способности предотвращает любое лечение, в том числе от фонтана, но не от способностей Sunder, Time Lapse и Supernova."],"notes_en":["Upon cast, this ability is replaced by Release, used to stop the tracer on the target area.","The area of effect is 300 + 50*TimeTraveled, capped at 1000.","Kill will be granted to the source of the damage that triggers the shatter.","The shatter effect doesn't work on illusions.","The HP Freeze prevents most kinds of healing, including the fountain, except Sunder, Time Lapse and Supernova."],"specials":[{"key":"radius_min","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[300.0],"percent":false},{"key":"radius_grow","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[50.0],"percent":false},{"key":"radius_max","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[1000.0],"percent":false},{"key":"path_radius","system":false,"heading_ru":"ШИРИНА ШАРА В ПОЛЁТЕ:","heading_en":"PATH RADIUS:","values":[300.0],"percent":false},{"key":"frostbite_d